  "document": {
    "abstract": "The purpose of this document is to define the recording criteria and conditions for:\n- soundtracks associated with trailers for feature films,\n- advertising films,\n- and, generally, all messages shown during the first part of the screening\nbased on the criterion of the sound energy delivered.",
    "abstract$meta": {
      "confidence": "medium",
      "note": "English translation of the publisher's French text",
      "originalValue": null,
      "reviewRequired": true,
      "source": "inferred",
      "sourceUrl": "https://cst.fr/download/33/recommandations-techniques/951/cst-rt-003.pdf",
      "updated": "2026-10-02T16:09:57.072Z",
      "version": "extractDocs.js@commit:41a6e931279b"
    },
    "abstractOriginal": "Le présent document a pour objet de définir les critères et conditions d'enregistrement des :\n- pistes sonores associées aux bandes annonces des films long métrage,\n- films publicitaires,\n- et d’une façon générale à tous les messages diffusés lors de la première partie de la séance\nsur le critère de l'énergie sonore délivrée.",
    "abstractOriginal$meta": {
      "confidence": "high",
      "note": "Read from the publisher's document or website",
      "originalValue": null,
      "source": "parsed",
      "sourceUrl": "https://cst.fr/download/33/recommandations-techniques/951/cst-rt-003.pdf",
      "updated": "2026-10-02T16:09:57.072Z",
      "version": "extractDocs.js@commit:41a6e931279b"
    },
    "details": "French-language CST recommendation, first revision (September 2009) of the 2001 original, on the loudness of cinema advertising and trailers on 35 mm and DCP. Sets a maximum of 85 dB Leq(m), measured per BS 5550-7.4.2 with a Dolby Model 737 or equivalent, and covers sound formats, measurement method, enforcement and an application date of 10 September 2009.",
